-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 17.12.98 (ארגון המורים), הפרשה לקופת גמל: the
-- agreement that carries out §10 of the collective agreement of 8.9.98 —
-- contributions to a provident fund from 1.1.98 on the salary components
-- and payments that are not pensionable. Whom it covers, save a
-- sabbatical's months away from teaching (§2); an annex to the agreement of
-- 8.9.98 (§3); the fund, chosen by the organisation with the wages
-- commissioner's consent (§4); 5% from the employer and 5% from the teacher
-- every month, save the tax gross-up and imputed benefit and any reward for
-- out-of-school activity, and none on the jubilee grant and the clothing
-- allowance of one on a budgetary pension; the retroactive contribution,
-- the sabbatical cases and the Wage Protection Law (§5); the sums the
-- employee is entitled to (§6); no contribution twice on one component
-- (§7); no precedent for other funds (§8); a future move to pension
-- contributions within the same cost (§9); the teachers who retired in
-- 1998 (§10); and two letters of the same day.
--
-- It is an annex to l4/agreements/oz-latmura/1998-09-08_oz-latmura_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul.l4
-- (imported). The Oz LaTmura agreement of 14.8.2011, §46(ב)–(ג)
-- (oz-founding-46), puts pension contributions in its place from 1.9.2011,
-- and keeps it, at its rates, for expense reimbursements and the clothing
-- allowance. It speaks to no pay item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is not in
-- oz-latmura-root.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `1998-09-08_oz-latmura_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — הפרשה לקופת גמל, ארגון המורים (17.12.1998)`

DECLARE `1998 provident-fund agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `act to apply the provident-fund agreement to the owners' teaching employees`
    `choose the teachers' provident fund`
    `consent in writing to the organisation's choice of fund`
    `transfer the provident-fund contributions`
    `make the retroactive provident-fund contribution`
    `pay the retired teacher's one-time sum`
    `make the new pension agreements`
    `reimburse the employer for the employee's share`
    `deduct the employee's share from the first salary on return`
    `discuss the teachers not employed in 5759`

