§§ `illustrations`

-- §5: 5% and 5% on an expense reimbursement of 400; none on a tax gross-up
-- or on a reward for out-of-school activity; the jubilee grant in an
-- accrual pension but not in a budgetary one; nothing before 1.1.98.
`5% and 5% of 400` MEANS
    `1998 provident-fund amounts` WITH
        `the employer's contribution` IS 20
        `the employee's deduction`    IS 20
#ASSERT `the 1998 provident-fund amounts on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 1998) `an expense reimbursement payment` `a budgetary pension` 400 EQUALS JUST `5% and 5% of 400`
#ASSERT `the 1998 provident-fund amounts on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 1998) `a tax gross-up payment` `an accrual pension` 400 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the 1998 provident-fund amounts on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 1998) `a reward for out-of-school activity` `an accrual pension` 400 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the 1998 provident-fund agreement contributes on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 1998) `the jubilee grant` `an accrual pension`
#ASSERT NOT `the 1998 provident-fund agreement contributes on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 1998) `the clothing allowance payment` `a budgetary pension`
#ASSERT `the 1998 provident-fund agreement contributes on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 1998) `the clothing allowance payment` `an accrual pension`
#ASSERT NOT `the 1998 provident-fund agreement contributes on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1997) `an expense reimbursement payment` `an accrual pension`
#ASSERT `the letter restates §5(ב)`
#ASSERT `the 1998 provident-fund agreement applies to` TRUE TRUE

-- §2(ב): a sabbatical month without teaching carries none.
#ASSERT NOT `a month carries provident-fund contributions under the 1998 agreement` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `a month carries provident-fund contributions under the 1998 agreement` TRUE TRUE

-- §7: never twice.
#ASSERT NOT `the 1998 provident-fund agreement contributes on the component` TRUE TRUE

-- §9: within 0.8%.
#ASSERT `the pension agreements take the place of the 1998 provident-fund agreement` TRUE TRUE (0.8%)
#ASSERT NOT `the pension agreements take the place of the 1998 provident-fund agreement` TRUE TRUE (0.9%)

-- §10: retired in June 1998, a one-time sum of the contributions; not in
-- December.
#ASSERT `a 1998 retiree is paid a one-time sum in place of contributions` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 1998)
#ASSERT NOT `a 1998 retiree is paid a one-time sum in place of contributions` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 1998)
#ASSERT `the 1998 retiree's one-time sum` (LIST 20, 20, 25) EQUALS 65

-- The fund §4 defines is the one §46(ב) of the Oz LaTmura agreement says
-- these contributions went to: a provident fund that does not pay an
-- annuity.
#ASSERT `the fund the 1998 provident-fund agreement pays into` EQUALS `a provident fund for employees' benefits`
